Notable modifications made in this fork:
  - Java package renamed from com.min01.morph to com.ajcat.minsmorph.
  - Added dynamic /morph data suggestions and improved entity data editing.
  - Fixed morph model/entity-data synchronization and client-side model refreshes.
  - Removed the vanilla 1024 max-health cap for morphs.
  - Added automatic flying-morph detection while keeping config overrides.
  - Improved mob effect immunity/inversion handling and incompatible-effect cleanup.
  - Added targetless ability support through an invisible close-range fake target.
  - Added support for Brain-based AI actions (activities/behaviors).
  - Added camera distance scaling for large morph models in third-person view.

